<title>THAILAND: Bank of Asia 1996 net up 23 percent.</title>
<headline>Bank of Asia 1996 net up 23 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Asia's unaudited financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   1996		     1995</p>
<p>    Share (baht)	     4.51	 vs	  4.20</p>
<p>    Net		    1,800.00	 vs    1,463.67</p>
<p>Notes -- Fourth quarter figures not available. Figures are unaudited, official figures expected in next few weeks. Bank of Asia Plc is a small Thai bank.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
